OL,3,GNEWSAChildren recycle flower 'carpet'
OL,4,Ainto mini artwork
OL,5,
OL,6,FChildren have made their own floral
OL,7,F"carpet" using flowers left over from a
OL,8,Fgiant artwork in Bradford city centre.
OL,10,FThe vast display in Centenary Square
OL,11,Fwas made from more than 330,000
OL,12,Fdahlias, with the design celebrating
OL,13,FBradford's textile history and
OL,14,Fmulticultural population.
OL,16,FSome of the flowers were donated to The
OL,17,FValley Project in Holme Wood after the
OL,18,Fartwork was taken away on Monday, with
OL,19,Fyoung people inspired to create their
OL,20,Fown smaller version.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
