OL,3,GNEWSAChildren recycle flower 'carpet'
OL,4,Ainto mini artwork
OL,5,
OL,6,FSteve McHugh, co-founder of The Valley
OL,7,FProject children's charity, said:
OL,8,F"Reusing and recycling is at the heart
OL,9,Fof everything we do, so when we were
OL,10,Foffered the leftover flowers we jumped
OL,11,Fat the chance.
